@template earnest

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- You missed your shift. Is everything all right? I don't mean to pry.

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- I know it's hard. But you can do this. I really think you can.   #warm

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- Please don't give up. Tell me what's wrong, and we'll work it out together.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- I'll set two alarms. One for me, one for you. Please, {nick}. One shift.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- You're turning up again. I'm so glad. I really am.   #warm

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- I wish I'd done more. I'm sorry. I'll miss you so much.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- You were a good friend to me. Remember that, wherever you go.   #warm
